# Managing Traditional Materials in an Online Environment: Some Definitions and Distinctions for a Future Collection Management.

**Authors:** Atkinson, Ross

## Abstract
Effective management of traditional materials will remain essential even when digital resources dominate scholarly communication. Examines traditional and digital objects in information services; provides an overview of collection management; discusses goal values, information services as purveyor and repository, the role of collection management, and the digital mentality; and presents a future model for objects in collections. (PEN)

